%description:
Tests the experimental TCP Fast Open option (kind 254 with the magic number
0xF989, RFC 7413 appendix A), with fastopenExpOptionEnabled on both sides.
The tester removes the Fast Open option of the SYN-ACK of connection 1, so its
cookie request (kind 34) has no answer. Connection 2 requests a cookie with
the experimental option, and the server answers in the same option. The
client caches the cookie with its option, and connection 3 sends the cookie
in the experimental option, with 200 bytes, which the server accepts.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.cli_app.tOpen3=1s
*.cli_app.active3=true
*.cli_app.localPort3=1002
*.cli_app.tSend3=1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes3=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen3=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000
*.srv_app.tOpen3=1s
*.srv_app.localPort3=2000

*.tcptester.script="b1 strip 34"
*.*_tcp.fastopenExpOptionEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize FastOpenExp(cookieLen=0)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize FastOpenExp(cookieLen=8)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A005] A.1002 > B.2000: S 250000:250200(200) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize FastOpenExp(cookieLen=8)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[1.003 B003] A.1002 < B.2000: A S 250500:250500(0) ack 250201 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TcpTestNet1.srv_app: received 200 bytes in 1 packets
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
